sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor User
  participant API as Auth API
  participant Validator as Zod Validator
  participant Redis
  participant Crypto as AES-GCM Utility
  participant Mongo as MongoDB

  User->>API: POST /auth/register
  API->>Validator: Validate registration input
  Validator-->>API: Canonical email + validated password
  API->>Mongo: Find user by canonical email
  Mongo-->>API: Not found
  API->>Crypto: Encrypt password
  Crypto-->>API: Authenticated ciphertext
  API->>Redis: Store pending user with encryptedPassword
  API->>Redis: Store hashed OTP and retry state
  API-->>User: OTP sent

  User->>API: POST /auth/register/verify-otp
  API->>Validator: Canonicalize email and validate OTP
  API->>Redis: Read and validate OTP
  Redis-->>API: OTP valid
  API->>Redis: Read pending registration
  Redis-->>API: name, canonical email, encryptedPassword
  API->>Crypto: Decrypt encryptedPassword
  Crypto-->>API: Plaintext password in process memory
  API->>Mongo: Transactionally create user and report settings

  alt Email remains available
    Mongo-->>API: Transaction committed
    API->>Redis: Delete registration state
    API-->>User: Account verified
  else Concurrent request already created email
    Mongo-->>API: Duplicate key code 11000
    API->>Redis: Delete stale registration state
    API-->>User: 409 Email already exists
  end

  User->>API: POST /auth/login
  API->>Validator: Canonicalize email; preserve password bytes
  API->>Mongo: Find user by canonical email

  alt User exists
    Mongo-->>API: User and password hash
    API->>API: bcrypt compare submitted password
  else User does not exist
    Mongo-->>API: Not found
    API->>API: bcrypt compare against dummy hash
  end

  alt Missing user or comparison failed
    API-->>User: 401 Invalid email or password
  else Valid credentials
    API-->>User: Existing successful login response
  end
